----------------------------------------------------------------------
Surface Type              Albedo       Reflection %    Description
----------------------------------------------------------------------
Water (open)              0.07         7.0             Dark, absorbs most solar
Blue Ice (transparent)    0.10         10.0            Dense, clear ice
White Ice (opaque)        0.60         60.0            Bubbles, opaque
